---
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CallToAction from '../../components/CallToAction.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import riverPhoto from '../../assets/communities/wichita/Wichita_River.jpg';
import downtownPhoto from '../../assets/communities/wichita/Wichita_Downtown.jpg';
import keeperPhoto from '../../assets/communities/wichita/Wichita_Keeper.jpg';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Wichita, Kansas Community Guide | Charity Menefee"
  description="A grounded introduction to Wichita, Kansas, with local imagery and practical real estate guidance from Charity Menefee."
  pageClass="page-interior page-wichita"
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Community guide · Wichita"
    title="A city with many ways to feel at home."
    intro="Wichita brings together established neighborhoods, newer residential areas, a recognizable riverfront, and the everyday conveniences of the region's largest city."
    image={riverPhoto}
    imageAlt="Wide view of the Arkansas River and the downtown Wichita skyline at sunset"
    variant="community"
    imagePosition="center 58%"
    imagePositionMobile="58% 55%"
  />

  <section class="section-space" aria-labelledby="wichita-overview-title">
    <div class="shell editorial-grid">
      <div data-reveal="left"><p class="eyebrow">Getting oriented</p><h2 id="wichita-overview-title">One city, a wide range of settings.</h2></div>
      <div class="prose" data-reveal="right">
        <p>Wichita sits at the heart of south-central Kansas. Its housing includes homes in long-established areas, infill near central districts, and newer construction toward the city's edges. The details can vary considerably from one part of the city to another.</p>
        <p>A useful search starts with the routines that matter to you: the parts of town you visit, the type of home you want to maintain, the amount of space you need, and the routes you expect to use. Those preferences can turn a broad citywide search into a more practical starting point.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="photo-story section-space section-surface" aria-labelledby="wichita-place-title">
    <div class="shell photo-story-grid">
      <div class="photo-story-copy" data-reveal="left">
        <p class="eyebrow">A sense of place</p>
        <h2 id="wichita-place-title">The Keeper anchors Wichita's riverfront.</h2>
        <p>The Keeper of the Plains is a recognizable part of Wichita's riverfront. Together with the Arkansas River and downtown skyline, it gives the city center a distinct sense of place. Beyond that center, Wichita unfolds through neighborhood streets, parks, commercial corridors, and residential areas.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="photo-story-main photo-story-keeper" data-reveal="right">
        <Picture src={keeperPhoto} formats={['avif', 'webp']} widths={[480, 720, 960, 1280]} sizes="(min-width: 48rem) 62vw, 100vw" alt="The Keeper of the Plains and cable-stayed bridge in Wichita at dusk" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="photo-story section-space section-sage" aria-labelledby="wichita-growth-title">
    <div class="shell photo-story-grid photo-story-reverse">
      <div class="photo-story-copy" data-reveal="right">
        <p class="eyebrow">Newer options</p>
        <h2 id="wichita-growth-title">New homes are part of the picture.</h2>
        <p>Wichita continues to grow in several directions, with new-home communities adding options alongside the city's established neighborhoods. Developments such as Estancia, Southern Ridge, Brookfield, and Fontana are a few examples of where newer construction is taking shape around the city.</p>
        <p>If a newer home or building from the ground up is something you're considering, it's worth comparing the location, lot, builder, neighborhood plans, taxes, and long-term costs just as carefully as the house itself.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="photo-story-main" data-reveal="left">
        <Picture src={downtownPhoto} formats={['avif', 'webp']} widths={[480, 720, 960, 1280]} sizes="(min-width: 48rem) 62vw, 100vw" alt="Downtown Wichita beside the Arkansas River in warm evening light" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-space" aria-labelledby="wichita-search-title">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-heading split-heading"><div data-reveal="left"><p class="eyebrow">Planning a search</p><h2 id="wichita-search-title">Useful questions before choosing a part of town.</h2></div><p data-reveal="right">These are practical starting points, but they are not a substitute for your own research or property-specific investigation.</p></div>
      <ul class="question-grid reveal-stagger">
        <li data-reveal="up">Which parts of Wichita fit the places you visit most often?</li>
        <li data-reveal="up">Do you prefer an older home, newer construction, or something in between?</li>
        <li data-reveal="up">How much yard and ongoing maintenance feel realistic?</li>
        <li data-reveal="up">Which property details need closer review once a home stands out?</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <nav class="shell next-community" aria-label="Community pages"><span>Next community</span><a href="/communities/valley-center/">Valley Center <i aria-hidden="true">→</i></a></nav>
  <CallToAction title="Thinking about a move within Wichita?" />
</BaseLayout>
